"Invoice %s with differents totals between Baxi XLS file (%.2f €) and Odoo "
"(%.2f €), operation canceled!"
msgstr ""
"Factura %s con totales diferentes entre el fichero XLS Baxi (%.2f €) y Odoo "
"(%.2f €), operación cancelada"

