#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_move_import_baxi.field_account_payment_mode__baxi_name
msgid ""
"This field is used for map payments mode when import Baxi invoices. You can "
"put several names separated by commas."
msgstr ""
"Este campo se usa para mapear modos de pago al importar facturas Baxi. Puede "
